---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = "Privacy Policy - Clipcy";
const description = "Clipcy Privacy Policy - Local clipboard manager with no data collection";
const locale = "en";
---

<Base title={title} description={description} locale={locale} currentPath="/privacy">
  <article class="privacy-page page-panel">
    <div class="container privacy-content">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="privacy-updated muted">Last updated: October 10, 2026</p>

      <p>Clipcy is a local clipboard manager that runs entirely on your device. Your privacy is our top priority.</p>

      <div class="privacy-highlight">
        <p><strong>Summary:</strong> Clipcy does not collect, transmit, or share any personal information. All data stays on your device.</p>
      </div>

      <h2>Data Collection</h2>
      <p><strong>None.</strong> Clipcy does not collect any personal information, usage data, analytics, telemetry, or crash reports.</p>

      <h2>Data Storage</h2>
      <p>All clipboard history and settings are stored locally on your device:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><code>%LOCALAPPDATA%\clipcy\clipcy.db</code> — Clipboard history database (SQLite)</li>
        <li><code>%LOCALAPPDATA%\clipcy\settings.json</code> — User preferences</li>
        <li><code>%LOCALAPPDATA%\clipcy\logs\</code> — Debug logs (local only)</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>No cloud sync.</strong> Your clipboard data never leaves your device.</p>

      <h2>Network Activity</h2>
      <p>Clipcy does not connect to the internet. There is no:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Analytics or telemetry</li>
        <li>Crash reporting</li>
        <li>Cloud synchronization</li>
        <li>Remote servers or APIs</li>
        <li>User accounts or authentication</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Permissions and Capabilities</h2>
      <p>Clipcy requires the following system permissions:</p>

      <h3>Clipboard Access</h3>
      <p>To save and retrieve clipboard history locally on your device.</p>

      <h3>Global Hotkey Registration</h3>
      <p>To trigger the app with keyboard shortcuts (default: <code>Alt+V</code>).</p>

      <h3>Auto-start (Optional)</h3>
      <p>To automatically launch Clipcy on Windows startup. You can disable this in settings.</p>

      <h3>Full Trust Execution (<code>runFullTrust</code>)</h3>
      <p>Required for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>System-wide hotkey registration</li>
        <li>Clipboard monitoring</li>
        <li>Paste operation simulation (Ctrl+V)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Data Retention</h2>
      <p>You control how long clipboard history is kept:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Configure max history items in settings</li>
        <li>Clear history anytime from the app</li>
        <li>Uninstalling Clipcy deletes all stored data</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p><strong>None.</strong> Clipcy does not integrate with or transmit data to any third-party services.</p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>Clipcy does not collect information from anyone, including children under 13.</p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>Any updates to this policy will be posted at this URL. Continued use of Clipcy after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>

      <h2>Open Source</h2>
      <p>Clipcy is open-source software. You can review the source code to verify our privacy claims:</p>
      <p><a href="https://github.com/daoanhthanh/clipcy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/daoanhthanh/clipcy</a></p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions or concerns, open an issue on GitHub:</p>
      <p><a href="https://github.com/daoanhthanh/clipcy/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/daoanhthanh/clipcy/issues</a></p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .privacy-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 8rem 0 4rem;
  }

  .privacy-content {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .privacy-content h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .privacy-updated {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .privacy-content h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    margin-top: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .privacy-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .privacy-content p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .privacy-content ul {
    margin-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .privacy-content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .privacy-content code {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Monaco, 'Cascadia Code', Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }

  .privacy-content strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .privacy-content a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .privacy-content a:hover {
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .privacy-highlight {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent-warm);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .privacy-highlight p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .privacy-page {
      padding: 6rem 0 3rem;
    }

    .privacy-content h2 {
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
